  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Noor Rehabilitation building 2023</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">We at Noor society  for People with Disabilities believe that people with disabilities are able to improve and can be independent in many life functions. We cannot let grief, loneliness and helplessness destroy their lives, it is important to provide rehabilitation and treatment as soon as possible.. Our rehabilitation center is located in Aida Palestinian refugee camp and covers an area of 120 square meters. We still need the money to buy a bigger building of 270 square meters with four floors.</narrative>
  </description>
